<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Hopewell.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Hopewell.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Wednesday it has issued 650 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hopewell Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$3.95	  PREMIUM	    15.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.1063	GEARING	    4.1X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	11.MAR.98   SETTLEMENT DATE  01.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     02.APR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$4.325	 MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
